        "original_id": "3fd01193-3c95-53aa-9174-9a6daa59361e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Count Basie\n- Products: Basie Meets Bond\n- Topics: James Bond films, jazz music\n\nFacts:\n- Count Basie was born on August 21, 1904, and he was an American jazz pianist, organist, bandleader, and composer.\n- Basie Meets Bond is a 1966 album by Count Basie and his orchestra.\n- Basie Meets Bond is a collection of musical pieces from the first four James Bond films: Dr. No, From Russia with Love, Goldfinger, and Thunderball.\n- Count Basie died on April 26, 1984.",
